WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.900
Henri, Marie, Laurent, Zoltán, Catherine, Juliette and plenty of others now win, on average, more than 10 hours a week.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.600
And not only that. Their teams communicate better.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.060
They are more productive, more effective, quicker to react.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.340
They see their data more clearly.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.040
They see their figures in real time.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:17.020
And above all, they know which decision to take at exactly which moment.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.840
And finally, they give a better client experience.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.840
Their clients genuinely tell them: “we are better served”.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:24.560
And it is true that they stay longer and order more.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:29.380
So quite simply, they managed to structure their growth steadily, through digital.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.040
But how, you are going to ask me?

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:32.240
It was not like that at the start.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.920
Because at the start, they were using generic tools like spreadsheets, for the less advanced ones.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.320
Even sheets of paper, and phone calls.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.180
When the company's expert left, the know-how left too.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.240
And the company had to stop for two weeks.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.080
But that could not hold any longer.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.520
So even though the more advanced ones were starting to use ChatGPT and Claude,

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:51.160
they felt scattered, and like they were losing time.

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:53.140
For them, digital was genuinely a dead weight.

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:54.400
But that changed.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.000
What changed, you are going to ask me?

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.280
They invested in custom-built software.

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:01.280
Custom-built, it is true, and you would be entirely right to say it back to me,

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.200
used to be reserved for large groups.

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.500
So you have Auchan, you have Orange.

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:08.460
In short, all the large groups have digital solutions of their own.

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:09.580
They own them.

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:12.360
And maybe that is also part of why they stand so high today.

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:13.420
They are close to a monopoly.

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:17.020
But at NateSystem, we have managed to build,

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.920
through our experience and our skills,

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:22.500
those same custom solutions for our clients.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.980
Smaller outfits than Auchan, obviously.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:28.980
So industry, consulting, restaurants, real estate, in short, any kind of B2B sector.

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:33.860
How do we work, and what is a real custom infrastructure?

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:37.860
At NateSystem, an infrastructure breaks down into three pillars.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.680
The first is the software part, the part you see, the visible one.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.380
You know, it is what sits on the computer.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:47.300
So it can be an application, a piece of software, a platform, a suite of software.

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:48.620
It is really what you see.

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:52.800
The AI part: it can be agentic AI, so with a lasting memory.

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:54.440
It can be AI agents.

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:57.180
It can also be AI automation,

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:59.960
so adding automation behind the software part.

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.100
And finally, the data analytics part.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:05.580
It is very underestimated, particularly in smaller groups.

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:08.100
But data is your competitive edge.

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:11.140
Data is not available to everyone.

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:13.920
Whereas now, with AI, anyone can become an expert on a subject.

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:16.220
But only your company has handled your own client cases.

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:17.620
So the data has to be used.

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:19.420
And with data analytics techniques,

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:23.000
we have won our clients time, and deals as well.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:26.360
The number of clients who have taken market share

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:28.000
from the biggest competitors in their sector,

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:29.300
thanks to hyper-personalisation,

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:32.660
meaning they had data and they used it at the right moment

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:34.220
to reach the right people,

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.540
by email in particular.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:37.860
But the solutions really are personalised.

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:38.580
That was only one example.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:39.940
Coming back to those solutions,

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:43.800
we pair the software part, the AI part and the data analytics part,

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:47.080
built to measure, to structure you digitally.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.620
How does it go?

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:49.720
We come into your company.

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:52.240
Step 1, we map your processes.

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:55.420
So we talk with your internal teams,

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:57.620
the ones on the operational side day to day, every day.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:00.500
But above all, we look at the processes you have now.

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:02.860
If you have none of them written on paper or in a spreadsheet,

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:03.980
no problem, we write them together.

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:06.680
Once we have that full map of every process,

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:07.160
every workflow,

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.620
at that point we go back to our side

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.140
and we build the software,

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:12.260
the solutions.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.340
There are the data analytics solutions.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.260
In short, we build those solutions to measure.

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.300
And we put them in place

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.500
from week 6 onwards.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:22.360
So once they are in place,

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:23.560
we watch how it goes

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:25.000
and we train your teams.

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:26.420
We adjust the solutions

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:28.280
so they fit your trade even more closely.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.080
The aim really is a perfect fit.

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:31.720
These are solutions for you.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:32.900
They are your solutions.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.380
Because we build them,

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:35.280
but they belong to you.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.900
And so we train your teams.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.700
Once your teams are fully autonomous

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:40.180
on the tools,

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:42.680
and only once your teams

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.280
use those tools all the time,

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:44.900
and you do too,

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.480
once you see for yourself

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.020
what it wins you

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.240
in time, in money,

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.300
in efficiency, in responsiveness,

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:52.260
at that point,

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:53.660
when you are autonomous

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:54.940
on all of that part,

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:56.300
the digital infrastructure,

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:57.520
